Write a Dart program using these inputs:
Input	Value
Customer	Rahul
Recharge price	₹299
Quantity	3
Cashback	₹50

Calculate the subtotal and final payable amount. Print a receipt and reject zero or negative quantities.

For the valid inputs, your program should calculate a subtotal of ₹897 and final payable amount of ₹847. */




double calculateTotal(double price, int quantity) {
  return price * quantity;
}

void main() {
  final String customerName = "Rahul";
  final double price = 299;
  final int quantity = 3;

  if (price < 0 || quantity < 0) {
    print("Price and Quantity cannot be Negative.");
    return;
  }
  final double subTotal = calculateTotal(price, quantity);

  final double cashBack = 50;

  final double finalAmount = subTotal - cashBack;

  print("Customer: $customerName");
  print("Recharge price: \₹${price.toStringAsFixed(2)}");
  print("Quantity: $quantity");
  print("Subtotal: \₹${subTotal.toStringAsFixed(2)}");
  print("Cashback: \ ₹${cashBack.toStringAsFixed(2)}");

  print(
    "Final payable amount              \₹${finalAmount.toStringAsFixed(2)}",
  );
}
